# 🎯 Placement Roadmap Made Easy

A simplified and practical roadmap for MCA students preparing for software engineering placements.

**Main Focus:** Python + DSA + SQL + Backend Development + Core CS + Projects

---

## 📌 1. Placement Preparation Priority

| Priority | Subject | Goal |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Python | Strong fundamentals and OOP |
| 2 | DSA | Solve coding problems independently |
| 3 | SQL | Master queries and database concepts |
| 4 | Core CS | DBMS, OS, CN, OOP |
| 5 | Aptitude | Practice timed questions |
| 6 | Backend Development | Build practical applications |
| 7 | Projects | Build and explain strong projects |

---

