## ⏳ 9. What to Skip Initially

These topics can be postponed until placement fundamentals are strong.

- Kubernetes
- Complex microservices
- Advanced CI/CD
- Advanced cloud infrastructure
- Advanced Deep Learning
- Transformers from scratch
- Advanced RAG techniques
- Learning multiple backend frameworks simultaneously
- Building every project in the roadmap
- Complex React frontend if focusing on backend placements

---

## 📅 10. Daily Study Routine — 3 Hours

| Activity | Time |
|---|---:|
| DSA | 75 minutes |
| Python / SQL | 45 minutes |
| Project Development | 45 minutes |
| Aptitude / Interview Revision | 15 minutes |
| **Total** | **180 minutes** |

### Weekly Routine
- Practice DSA regularly.
- Write SQL queries several days per week.
- Build one project feature every week.
- Push code to GitHub.
- Revise previously solved problems.
- Take one aptitude or mock test.
- Practice explaining projects aloud.

